  partName: Valve Cover (2)
  description: The Valve Cover (2) is positioned at the middle-center-center of the
    engine, covering the valve train and protecting it from debris and contaminants.
    Its medium size and complex shape are designed to provide a secure seal around
    the valves, while also allowing for easy access and maintenance. An interesting
    feature of the valve cover is its internal baffling, which helps to reduce oil
    splashing and promote a clean environment for the valve train.
